  = help: an actor is started in a scope, `s.spawn(Counter { … })`, and reached only through its methods; what crosses its boundary is copied and may hold no `Ref`

error[E0475]: actor `A` can't hold or exchange a `U`: it is the type parameter `U`, not bounded `Sendable`
  --> tests/programs/concurrency/actors/e0439_generic_method.la:3:26
  |
3 |     fun pick<U>(self, u: U): T = self.x;
  |                          ^
  |
  = help: add `Sendable` to its bounds: `<T: Sendable>`

